Stark Rust backend

Behavioral compatibility and test fixtures for `apply_patch`, the `execpolicy`
prefix-rule/decision engine, and unified-exec head/tail output buffering are
derived from OpenAI Codex (https://github.com/openai/codex), licensed under
Apache-2.0.
See docs/rust-rewrite/01-codex-reference.md for the reference mapping.

`backend-rs/vendor/portable-pty` is portable-pty 0.9.0
(https://github.com/wez/wezterm/tree/main/pty), Copyright (c) 2018 Wez Furlong,
licensed under MIT. It is vendored with two local fixes: ConPTY is created with
the resize-quirk flag only (avoiding cursor/inherit-input hangs), and
TerminateProcess result handling is corrected.
